status GREEN -- cold roster 245 run, 242 green, 0 red, 3 gated at named custody gates, tree_moved=no; reds_pin_capacity witness and its 65-leg control green with both mutations proven; reds_ledger_monotone, reds_citation, unshared_citation, ascii_document, prose_register, living_docs_lint, itinerary_account_shelf, living_pin_near_bound all green on metal. rule_twin reads cohort drift 38 over a ceiling of 35 -- pre-existing, gated at %7, unchanged by this lap and re-measured at 38 after it. QA: the-baton.md B+/85, the shelf A+/100, the scan's comments B+/85.
recommend keep-going -- five unheld rows remain named on every run (%700 %646 %569 %549 %519 %460) and the same move closes each: re-prove the repair on metal, accrete BOOKED, fold. The card itself now sits 2 bytes under its own bound, which is the REDS pin's shape one page over and wants your word rather than another lap of trimming.
